    "code": "import torch\n\ndef tsm_shift(x, shift=1):\n    # x: [B,T,C,H,W]\n    b, t, c, h, w = x.shape\n    out = torch.zeros_like(x)\n    out[:, 1:, :c//3] = x[:, :-1, :c//3]\n    out[:, :-1, c//3:2*c//3] = x[:, 1:, c//3:2*c//3]\n    out[:, :, 2*c//3:] = x[:, :, 2*c//3:]\n    return out",
