    "beginnerSummary": "数据pipeline像给流水线送料，料送慢了机器就空转；多雇几个搬运工（workers）、提前备料（prefetch）就能让机器一直转。",
    "diagram": "\n GPU: [calc][wait][calc][wait][calc]   <- 卡顿\n 优化:[calc][calc][calc][calc]         <- 数据提前备好\n workers: 4 -> 16, +persistent +prefetch\n",
