    "code": "# Python (KV 量化示意)\ndef quantize_kv(k, bits=8):\n    # 按 head/group 量化 key/value 缓存\n    s = k.abs().amax(dim=-1, keepdim=True) / (2**(bits-1)-1)\n    k_q = (k / s).round().clamp(-(2**(bits-1)), 2**(bits-1)-1)\n    return k_q, s                                 # 注意时重算 s 反量化",
