    "code": "# Python (敏感度=量化前后输出差异)\ndef layer_sensitivity(layer, x, bits=4):\n    y_fp = layer(x)\n    y_q  = layer(quantize_weights(layer.weight, bits))(x)\n    return (y_fp - y_q).pow(2).mean().item()     # 越大越敏感→留高精度",
